---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="The Photographer"
  description="Meet Caleb, the photographer behind Bitterroot Boudoir in Stevensville, Montana."
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="wrap photographer">
      <div class="bio">
        <h1 class="reveal">Meet Caleb</h1>
        <p class="subheader reveal reveal-delay-1">Your Photographer</p>

        <div class="bio-copy reveal reveal-delay-2">
          <p>
            I began my photographic journey in the wild, photographing landscapes
            and the natural world. Nature taught me how to study a subject, and
            how light can reveal moments of quiet drama and breathtaking beauty.
            I learned that a photographer’s job isn’t to create beauty but rather
            to find what’s already there and honor it through light and perspective.
          </p>
          <p>
            For me, boudoir is no different. Every body is its own unique
            landscape, shaped by curves, lines, and stories. When light falls
            across it just right, it reveals an elegance that can be emotionally
            moving.
          </p>
          <p>
            My goal is to help you fall in love with your own image. Not just
            with a favorite photo or two, but with the person in them. I want you
            to leave our session seeing yourself the way I see you, and carrying
            that confidence long after the images are delivered.
          </p>
          <p>
            There's beauty in all of us and we all owe it to ourselves to
            discover it.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="cta-row reveal reveal-delay-3">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact">Contact</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <img
        class="portrait reveal reveal-delay-3"
        src="/images/about/photographer.webp"
        alt="Caleb, photographer at Bitterroot Boudoir"
        loading="eager"
        decoding="async"
      />
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .photographer {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-md);
    align-items: end;
  }

  .portrait {
    width: min(100%, 26rem);
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
    object-fit: cover;
    background: var(--surface);
  }

  .subheader {
    margin: -0.35em 0 1.25em;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 2vw, 1.2rem);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .bio-copy {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1em;
  }

  .bio-copy p {
    margin: 0;
  }

  @media (min-width: 860px) {
    .photographer {
      grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 0.85fr;
      gap: 3rem;
    }
  }
</style>
